    "problems": "The experiments concern weight-space region overlap rather than functional effects on refusal or general capability. The paper notes its English-dominant dataset and moderate-scale model coverage and that IoU measures only set overlap. SafeLayer Stage II could not be reproduced consistently; the authors also state that they do not investigate activation-level analyses.",
    "rows_left_out": "SafeLayer stage analyses and single-category semantic-similarity/correlation results are not included as rows because they concern layer localization or dataset semantics rather than the specified residual-stream direction or its predicted refusal effects. Detailed pairwise matrices and additional threshold/seed cases are also omitted; the rows retain the Table 2 multi-category summaries.",
